6. Let the applicant Ritik Gupta Alias Boni be released on bail in aforesaid FIR number on his furnishing a personal bond with two sureties of Rs.20,000/- each to the satisfaction of court concerned with the following conditions:
(a) The applicant shall execute a bond to undertake to attend the hearings;
(b) The applicant shall not commit any offence similar to the offence of which he is accused or suspected of the commission; and Ritik Gupta Alias Boni vs State Of U.P. Thru. Addl. Chief Secy. ...

